+### When you use the chat assistant
+
+Bandit, the chat assistant in the corner of each page, is an AI assistant. What you type, and the replies, are sent to Anthropic, the company whose AI model writes the replies, along with the address of the page you are on. We do not store the conversation, and Bandit does not ask for your name or contact details. Please leave out personal, health or financial information; if you want us to get back to you, use a form or email us.
+
+So the conversation carries on as you move between pages, your browser keeps it until you close the tab. It also remembers if you closed the assistant, so it does not keep popping up. Neither is a cookie, and neither is sent to us.
+
 ### When you browse the site
 
 If you accept analytics cookies, Google Analytics records which pages you visit, how you arrived, roughly where in the world you are (country and city level), and the type of device and browser you use. See [Cookies and analytics](#cookies-and-analytics) below. If you do not accept, none of this is collected.
